  "details": "1. Turn on Camera Face Capture on PC\n\n 2. Change the capture quality to any option higher than \"Performance\"\n\n 3. Enter a world that uses Shift+F1 ~ F8 hotkeys to control avatar poses and hand gestures, for example worlds with pre-built dance animations\n\n Expected result:\n\n Shift+F1-F8 gesture controls should function normally. Expressions should not be locked.\n\n Actual result:\n\n When capture quality is above Performance, the face capture system overrides and locks Shift+F1-F8 gestures into a fist pose. Expressions are unaffected.\n\n This breaks animations in worlds with pre-made dance sequences, as the hands stay stuck as fists.\n\n Additional information:\n\n The issue goes away after switching capture quality back to \"Performance\".",
